What:		/proc/oplus_mem/sigkill_reason
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only view of the donor's twenty-entry SIGKILL diagnosis ring.
		Each newest-first record is four comma-separated integers describing
		the target TGID/UID and signal sender TGID/UID.  Wave 21 invokes the
		recorder from the native Linux 4.14 do_send_sig_info path because
		this kernel predates the Android 5.4 vendor signal hook used by 9R.

Users:		OnePlus Android 14 Athena process-management service
